IMPORTANT: When deploying to Vercel via dashboard:

1. Set Root Directory: apps/marketing
2. Let Vercel auto-detect everything else
3. Vercel will automatically detect pnpm from pnpm-lock.yaml in root
4. Build command will be: pnpm run build (from apps/marketing)
5. Vercel handles monorepo workspace dependencies automatically

DO NOT override build/install commands unless necessary.
